      "text": "brute force\n\nprofit = 0\n\nfor i = 0  ; i< n ;i++\n\n    for(int j = i+1 ; j < n ; j++\n        \n        profit = max(profit , arr[j] -arr[i])",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "brute force\n\nprofit = 0\n\nfor i = 0  ; i< n ;i++\n\n    for(int j = i+1 ; j < n ; j++\n        \n        profit = max(profit , arr[j] -arr[i])",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
