      "text": "int solve(int index,int trasactionType) :\n    \n    if(index==n)\n        return 0\n\n    // skip this day\n\n    ans1 = solve(index+1,trasactionType)\n\n    \n    // perform the possible transactions\n    \n    if trasactionType===BUY:\n        ans2 = -prices[index]+solve(index+1,SELL)\n    else :\n        ans2 = prices[index]// break as 1 txs\n\n    return max(ans1,ans2)\n\n\nmain():\n\n    //input\n    \n    ans = solve(0,BUY)\n    \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "int solve(int index,int trasactionType) :\n    \n    if(index==n)\n        return 0\n\n    // skip this day\n\n    ans1 = solve(index+1,trasactionType)\n\n    \n    // perform the possible transactions\n    \n    if trasactionType===BUY:\n        ans2 = -prices[index]+solve(index+1,SELL)\n    else :\n        ans2 = prices[index]// break as 1 txs\n\n    return max(ans1,ans2)\n\n\nmain():\n\n    //input\n    \n    ans = solve(0,BUY)\n    \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
