      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "int solve(int i,int j) :\n\n    // base case\n\n    if(j==t.size()) return 1;\n\n    if(i==s.size())\n        return 0;\n\n    // not take it\n    int ans = solve(i+1,j)\n\n    // take it\n    int ans2 = 0;\n\n    if s[i==t[j] :\n        ans2 = solve(i+1,j+1)\n\n    return ans1+ans2\n\n\nmain:\n\n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "int solve(int i,int j) :\n\n    // base case\n\n    if(j==t.size()) return 1;\n\n    if(i==s.size())\n        return 0;\n\n    // not take it\n    int ans = solve(i+1,j)\n\n    // take it\n    int ans2 = 0;\n\n    if s[i==t[j] :\n        ans2 = solve(i+1,j+1)\n\n    return ans1+ans2\n\n\nmain:\n\n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
